# Build logs, whether generated for benchmarks or copied from a real build. Real ones carry
# absolute paths, target and project names and the source layout of whatever was built, so they
# must not be committed; generated ones are derived artifacts that anyone can regenerate from
# Benchmarks/Profiles.
